import{_ as i,o as a,c as t,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 570 | Acceleration Domain | Law-Origin Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Law Perception","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 570 | Acceleration Domain | Law-Origin Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Law Perception","no":570,"module":3,"tags":["Origin Acceleration Domain","Law-Origin Realm","Law Perception","Realm Adaptation","Time-Flow Rate"],"related":["502-Origin Acceleration-Domain Time-Flow-Rate Regulation Principle","14-Unified Cultivation-Realm Classification","21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principles"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0570_模块3-加速域-法元境适配.md","filePath":"en/0570_模块3-加速域-法元境适配.md"}'),o={name:"en/0570_模块3-加速域-法元境适配.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,d,u){return a(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-570-acceleration-domain-law-origin-realm-adaptation-—-acceleration-of-law-perception" tabindex="-1">Entry 570 | Acceleration Domain | Law-Origin Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Law Perception <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-570-acceleration-domain-law-origin-realm-adaptation-—-acceleration-of-law-perception" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 570 | Acceleration Domain | Law-Origin Realm Adaptation — Acceleration of Law Perception&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain Civilizational-Experience System | Benchmark base: Documents 14, 21; Benchmark library: Entry 569</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-threshold-from-using-energy-to-reading-law" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the threshold from &quot;using energy&quot; to &quot;reading law&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-threshold-from-using-energy-to-reading-law" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the threshold from &quot;using energy&quot; to &quot;reading law&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>After Transform-Origin, the cultivator enters Law-Origin. This realm&#39;s core task undergoes qualitative change: no longer dealing with energy, but directly <strong>perceiving law itself</strong> (Document 14). Law is the universe&#39;s underlying operating rule; it is not like energy that may be &quot;absorbed&quot; into the body, only &quot;read&quot; by consciousness. The Law-Origin cultivator&#39;s goal is to let his consciousness stably connect to the law network, discern specific clauses such as Fire Law, Water Law, Causality Law, Time Law, and form in consciousness a preliminary understanding of these clauses.</p><p>Six top-level axioms rise to new height in Law-Origin: anti-predation axiom requires law perception be public reading, not monopolistic hoarding; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires all beings have the right to read law&#39;s original text, forbidding the strong from &quot;enclosing land&quot; over law; collective ascension axiom requires each cultivator&#39;s law understanding returned to Alaya Network, piecing together Myriad Ranks&#39; common law atlas; causal self-discipline axiom requires when reading law no over-authority modification, read-only not write; law-first axiom takes &quot;Law-Origin adapted flow&quot; as part of law itself, never retconned. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-law-perception-may-be-accelerated" tabindex="-1">I. Why Law Perception May Be Accelerated <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-law-perception-may-be-accelerated" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why Law Perception May Be Accelerated&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Different from Transform-Origin&#39;s energy qualitative change, law perception is essentially <strong>information-processing work</strong>. Consciousness &quot;reads&quot; clauses in the law network, like a scholar reading in a library. Since it is information processing, it naturally suits being accelerated:</p><ul><li>Law clauses are stable, public, do not change with time-flow rate;</li><li>Consciousness in accelerated state may simultaneously process more law clauses in parallel;</li><li>Multiplication Fruit Technology (Document 16) has highest amplification efficiency on information-processing tasks.</li></ul><p>Thus Law-Origin is the nine realms&#39; <strong>best suited to enjoying high-multiple acceleration dividends</strong> realm. The Origin Acceleration Domain opens 50× to 200× flow gears for Law-Origin, the highest gear among the five mortal-cultivation realms.</p><h2 id="ii-law-origin-acceleration-gear-parameters" tabindex="-1">II. Law-Origin Acceleration-Gear Parameters <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-law-origin-acceleration-gear-parameters" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Law-Origin Acceleration-Gear Parameters&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Explanation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Recommended Flow</td><td>50–200×</td><td>Highest gear among five mortal-cultivation realms</td></tr><tr><td>Reading Permission</td><td>Full read of law network public layer</td><td>Deep law needs higher-realm permission</td></tr><tr><td>Parallel Clauses</td><td>Perceive 3–7 laws simultaneously</td><td>More than 7 causes consciousness tearing</td></tr><tr><td>Understanding Return</td><td>Immediately return to Alaya after reading each law</td><td>Prevent personal hoarding</td></tr><tr><td>Cooldown Requirement</td><td>Mandatory 4-hour cooldown per 100 consecutive acceleration hours</td><td>Prevent consciousness overload</td></tr></tbody></table><p>This parameter&#39;s core is &quot;high-multiple parallel, immediate return, mandatory cooldown.&quot; High-multiple parallel lets the cultivator in the acceleration domain use a few months to read law clauses that in reality would take decades; immediate return ensures the understanding he reads is not hoarded, but immediately becomes a piece of the Myriad-Rank law atlas; mandatory cooldown prevents consciousness from being &quot;burned through&quot; under 200× flow.</p><h2 id="iii-myriad-rank-co-building-of-the-law-atlas" tabindex="-1">III. Myriad-Rank Co-Building of the Law Atlas <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-myriad-rank-co-building-of-the-law-atlas" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Myriad-Rank Co-Building of the Law Atlas&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Each time a Law-Origin cultivator finishes reading a law, his &quot;understanding version&quot; is recorded by the Alaya Network. The same law clause may have thousands of cultivators each reading slightly different versions — some emphasize Fire Law&#39;s combustion aspect, some its transformation aspect, some its intersection with Time Law. The Alaya Network pieces these versions into a <strong>Myriad-Rank Law Atlas</strong>:</p><ul><li>Each version annotated with reader, realm, lineage;</li><li>Differences between versions algorithmically highlighted, prompting &quot;here is a seam not yet understood&quot;;</li><li>Cultivators may see on the atlas how their understanding overlaps with Myriad-Rank understanding.</li></ul><p>This mechanism turns &quot;reading law&quot; from personal solitary cultivation into Myriad-Rank co-building. In the old predatory-faction system, law insights are sect secrets, masters hold back, disciples hold back more; centuries later one law is read into a残缺 version; in Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, the law atlas from day one is alive, complete, continuously growing.</p><h2 id="iv-opposition-to-monopolizing-law" tabindex="-1">IV. Opposition to &quot;Monopolizing Law&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-opposition-to-monopolizing-law" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Opposition to &quot;Monopolizing Law&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the predatory-faction system, the strong treat law insights as highest private property: closed-door self-enlightenment, sect secret transmission, master-disciple single transmission, even deliberately releasing wrong versions to mislead competitors. This approach&#39;s consequences:</p><ol><li>Law understanding monopolized; 99% of beings in Myriad Ranks never touch true law original text in their lives;</li><li>The monopolist&#39;s own understanding also stagnates for lack of comparison, still trapped on the same layer centuries later;</li><li>It trains &quot;misers,&quot; not &quot;builders.&quot;</li></ol><p>Heng Yuan Zhou in Law-Origin acceleration gear makes &quot;understanding return&quot; mandatory: no return, no permission to enter the next acceleration stage. This rule from time permission makes &quot;hoarding law&quot; directly lose on the cultivation ledger — you want to monopolize? Then don&#39;t think about accelerating.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: put the highest-multiple acceleration on Law-Origin, best suited to information processing, avoiding wasting law-network load on the energy-qualitative-change segment</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: law publicly read, understanding mandatorily returned; institutionally eliminate &quot;enclosing law&quot; predation space</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style law insights rely on master-sect empowerment, secret-realm fortune; monopolized in few hands; Heng Yuan&#39;s law atlas opens to 99% of Myriad Ranks</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: five lineages each have law-perception channels; plant spirits perceive &quot;Growth Law,&quot; planet consciousness perceives &quot;Gravity Law&quot;; the atlas is divided by lineage volumes</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: law-atlas structure, parallel algorithm, cooldown parameters all public; this is the high-tier segment of the open chain</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Law-Origin is the first stage where a cultivator truly &quot;understands the universe.&quot; The Origin Acceleration Domain here gives the highest-multiple flow, because reading law the faster the better, the more people read the better. But acceleration&#39;s precondition is &quot;hand it over as soon as read&quot; — this is precisely Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s most fundamental attitude toward knowledge: <strong>reading fast is ability; reading openly is responsibility.</strong></p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./569_模块3-加速域-化元境适配.html">569-Acceleration-Domain Transform-Origin Adaptation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation-Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/21-共生网络运作原理.html">21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principles</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',26)])])}const m=i(o,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
